    "details": "<p><strong>Join the official WhatsApp group for updates &amp; support:</strong><br /><a title=\"WhatsApp Group\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/D9M4aPHMQQbGoJWeM74CW1?s=cl&amp;p=a&amp;ilr=4&amp;iam=2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/D9M4aPHMQQbGoJWeM74CW1?s=cl&amp;p=a&amp;ilr=4&amp;iam=2</a></p>\n<p><strong>AIVORA 2K26</strong> is a global online hackathon by <strong>Innovation Hacks</strong> where participants turn real-world problems into practical AI-powered solutions.</p>\n<p><strong>Problem Statements</strong></p>\n<p>Choose <strong>ONE</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AI Productivity &amp; Automation</strong></li>\n<li><strong>AI for Education</strong></li>\n<li><strong>AI for Sustainability</strong></li>\n<li>️ <strong>AI for Healthcare</strong></li>\n<li><strong>AI for Business</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Prize Pool &mdash; ₹20,000</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1st &mdash; <strong>₹10,000</strong></li>\n<li>2nd &mdash; <strong>₹6,000</strong></li>\n<li>3rd &mdash; <strong>₹4,000</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility &amp; Format</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to students, developers, innovators &amp; tech enthusiasts.</li>\n<li><strong>Individual or teams of 1&ndash;4 members</strong></li>\n<li>Inter-college teams <strong>allowed</strong></li>\n<li>Inter-specialization teams <strong>allowed</strong></li>\n<li>Online participation</li>\n<li>Choose one problem statement and build an original solution.</li>\n<li>AI tools, APIs, frameworks and open-source technologies are allowed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Submit only original work.</li>\n<li>One project per team.</li>\n<li>Plagiarism may lead to disqualification.</li>\n<li>Submit before the deadline.</li>\n<li>Judges' decision will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Build with AI. Solve real problems. Create impact. </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Organized by Innovation Hacks</strong><br /><em>Build &bull; Innovate &bull; Impact</em></p>"